    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Craft 4 <style=item>tree taps</style> and <style=item>buckets</style>,
        then place them on the 4 large maple trees around here. They must be brimming
        with <style=item>maple sap</style>, so it shouldn't take long to fill each
        bucket!
